{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>A kingdom of priests</b> — Onkelos renders: \"and you shall be a kingdom of servants\" (i.e., ministers who serve)." "<b>And a holy nation</b> — to cleave to the Holy El, as He said: \"You shall be holy, for I, YHWH, am holy\" (Leviticus 19:2). And behold, He promised them in this world and in the world to come."], :book :exodus, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {0 "Onkelos to Exodus 19:6 renders ממלכת כהנים as מלכותא דמשרתיא, \"a kingdom of ministers/servants.\" Ramban quotes the Aramaic in Hebrew form."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T03:10:39.945574423Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}